\par All hardware is redundant and load balanced. A single hardware failure will not end up in a total system down time. With the mechanism of load balancing we can easily add hardware to have high performance with growing customer numbers. Even more important
 as hardware is the software we use. In our experience one of the common mistakes is to try to get more performance out of more hardware instead of software improvements.
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\lang1033\langfe1031\langnp1033 
